& [I03E3_001_008] cover identity authority independence and oracles
  + I03E3-001 exact I03E1 I03E2 sources profiles trust and code lineage
  + I03E3-002 separate expectation observation comparison and admission authority
  + I03E3-003 generator cannot authorize expectation
  + I03E3-004 implementation output cannot define expected result
  + I03E3-005 comparator preserves and cannot rewrite both inputs
  + I03E3-006 procedural invocation and principal independence classes
  + I03E3-007 exact stage-specific byte schema typed semantic and authority oracles
  + I03E3-008 no f64 result-copy or implementation-laundered oracle

& [I03E3_009_016] cover receipts principals trust and evidence identity
  + I03E3-009 complete per-stage CaseExpectationReceipt
  + I03E3-010 CommonSyntaxClaim schema and typed ClaimWitnessReceipt
  + I03E3-011 individually reviewed root-qualified CoverageMappingReceipt
  + I03E3-012 person or authorized provenance-bound faculty ReviewerPrincipal
  + I03E3-013 exact review-run faculty profile engine job input output and resource identity
  + I03E3-014 signed future TrustedReviewerCatalogue role key validity and revocation
  + I03E3-015 integrity digest checksum attestation and digital signature separation
  + I03E3-016 raw model output alone has zero review authority

& [I03E3_017_024] cover faculty cross confirmation and signature
  + I03E3-017 independent HonestyPrimary without peer digest
  + I03E3-018 independent SecurityPrimary without peer digest
  + I03E3-019 HonestyCrossAck binds both primary digests
  + I03E3-020 SecurityCrossAck binds both primary digests
  + I03E3-021 envelope binds two primaries two acknowledgments trust and independence
  + I03E3-022 peer acknowledgment cannot issue the peer faculty conclusion
  + I03E3-023 no self or mutual digest recursion
  + I03E3-024 optional signature requires algorithm key catalogue bytes and verification

& [I03E3_025_032] cover dissent successors batches faculty kernel and Observer
  + I03E3-025 durable affirm challenge abstain and insufficient-evidence dissent
  + I03E3-026 unresolved dissent blocks affected subject
  + I03E3-027 successor correction never deletes predecessor evidence
  + I03E3-028 case receipt review and trust changes invalidate exact dependents
  + I03E3-029 batch review enumerates every case and preserves exceptions
  + I03E3-030 sampling never admits unreviewed cases
  + I03E3-031 Scribe Refiner Weaver Planner Honesty Security Observer receipt cycle
  + I03E3-032 Observer closed disposition and candidate-without-execution boundary

& [I03E3_033_040] cover completeness determinism limits source and authority
  + I03E3-033 total reconstructed expectation claim edge faculty envelope and dissent accounts
  + I03E3-034 deterministic canonical ordering encoding and domain digests
  + I03E3-035 normative evidence excludes volatile commentary and private reasoning
  + I03E3-036 finite checked receipt edge dissent batch reference rationale and byte limits
  + I03E3-037 exhaustion preserves unreviewed subjects and blocks candidate formation
  + I03E3-038 exact future verifier trust review fixture source inventory and no secret handling
  + I03E3-039 adversarial self-confirmation trust cross dissent batch completeness proof
  + I03E3-040 zero receipt issuance signing execution compatibility admission production or hardware authority

